      "options": {
        "content": "### Trace and Log Correlation\n\n1. Open **Jaeger Trace Search** from dashboard links (top right).\n2. Query traces for service `rps-backend`.\n3. In CloudWatch or Loki logs, filter JSON logs by `trace_id` and `span_id`.\n4. Use that `trace_id` in Jaeger to inspect end-to-end spans.",
